flowchart TB
  S(["You need a chart that looks a certain way"]):::you
  Q1{"Can a built-in Power BI<br/>visual do it with formatting?"}:::n
  Q2{"Can an SVG measure in an<br/>image visual do it?"}:::n
  A1["Use the built-in visual<br/>(no code to maintain)"]:::g
  A2["Use the SVG KPI pattern<br/>(Chapter 7)"]:::g
  A3["Build a custom visual with the kit<br/>e.g. IBCS variance table, or replacing<br/>an expired paid visual"]:::aa
  S --> Q1
  Q1 -- "yes" --> A1
  Q1 -- "no" --> Q2
  Q2 -- "yes" --> A2
  Q2 -- "no" --> A3
